studio/xreader.py  The free X reader (one public post a person links; no X API key)
  - react-tweet (Vercel)  https://github.com/vercel/react-tweet  Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 Vercel, Inc.
      The syndication endpoint (cdn.syndication.twimg.com/tweet-result) and its token formula
      ((Number(id) / 1e15) * Math.PI).toString(36) with zeros and the dot removed, re-implemented in Python
      (syndication_token, with a port of V8's Number.prototype.toString(radix) so the token matches exactly).
  - FixTweet / FxTwitter  https://github.com/FixTweet/FxTwitter  Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) FixTweet contributors.
      Its public API (api.fxtwitter.com/status/<id>) is called as a fallback for the full text and media URLs; no code
      copied.
  These are unofficial public endpoints that can change or break; X's Terms restrict scraping. HuhQueue reads only the
  single public post a person links, on demand, and never crawls, searches or bulk-collects X. Recorded responses for
  one public post are kept as test fixtures (tests/studio/fixtures/x/).

